      ],
      "text": "Executive summary",
      "font": "SegoeUI",
      "size": 32.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        187.64593505859375,
        182.94140625,
        212.44093322753906
      ],
      "text": "Introduction",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        217.8917999267578,
        527.284423828125,
        232.3347930908203
      ],
      "text": "Children and young adolescents (aged below 15 years) represent about 11% of all people with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        231.09193420410156,
        527.4521484375,
        245.53492736816406
      ],
      "text": "tuberculosis (TB) globally. This means that 1.1 million children become ill with TB every year, almost",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        244.2919464111328,
        527.4411010742188,
        258.7349548339844
      ],
      "text": "half of them below five years of age. National TB programmes (NTPs) only notify less than half of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        254.6978302001953,
        527.416748046875,
        271.9348449707031
      ],
      "text": "(1) these children, meaning that there is a large case detection gap  . The reasons for this gap include",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        270.69183349609375,
        527.428955078125,
        285.1348571777344
      ],
      "text": "challenges with specimen collection and bacteriological confirmation of TB in young children, due",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        283.89178466796875,
        524.3997192382812,
        298.3348083496094
      ],
      "text": "to the paucibacillary nature of TB disease in this age group and the lack of highly sensitive point-of-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        297.0919189453125,
        527.3770751953125,
        311.5349426269531
      ],
      "text": "care tests. In 2020, the COVID-19 pandemic had an additional negative impact on TB notifications",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        310.29193115234375,
        527.4520874023438,
        324.7349548339844
      ],
      "text": "in children. In addition to the case detection gap, only one third of child contacts below five years of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        323.4917907714844,
        527.4475708007812,
        337.934814453125
      ],
      "text": "age eligible for TB preventive treatment (TPT) received it in 2020. Young children are at higher risk of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        336.6918029785156,
        527.4048461914062,
        351.13482666015625
      ],
      "text": "developing TB disease, including severe forms of TB, after TB infection, and the majority do so within",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        347.09783935546875,
        527.4326171875,
        364.3348388671875
      ],
      "text": "(2, 3) a few months following exposure and infection  . In addition to children and young adolescents,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        360.29779052734375,
        524.4075927734375,
        377.5348205566406
      ],
      "text": "(4) over half a million older adolescents (aged 15–19 years) are estimated to develop TB every year  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        382.0018310546875,
        527.4229125976562,
        399.23883056640625
      ],
      "text": "(5) The United Nations Sustainable Development Goal (SDGs)   and the World Health Organization",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        395.20184326171875,
        527.414306640625,
        412.4388427734375
      ],
      "text": "End TB Strategy (6) (WHO)   include targets to reduce TB incidence by 80% and TB deaths by 90% to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        411.19580078125,
        527.4300537109375,
        425.6388244628906
      ],
      "text": "be achieved by the year 2030, relative to baseline levels in 2015. In addition, to accelerate progress",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        424.39581298828125,
        527.658935546875,
        438.8388366699219
      ],
      "text": "towards these global targets, the Resolution adopted by the United Nations General Assembly at the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.99839973449707,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.5957946777344,
        527.4090576171875,
        452.038818359375
      ],
      "text": "High-Level Meeting on the fight against tuberculosis in September 2018 commits to diagnosing and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        450.7958068847656,
        524.3829345703125,
        465.23883056640625
      ],
      "text": "treating 40 million people with TB (including 3.5 million children), and 1.5 million people with drug-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        463.9958190917969,
        527.3847045898438,
        478.4388427734375
      ],
      "text": "resistant TB (DR-TB) (including 115 000 children) by 2022. It also commits to providing at least 30",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        477.19580078125,
        527.380615234375,
        491.6388244628906
      ],
      "text": "million people (including 4 million child contacts under five years of age), 20 million other household",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        490.39581298828125,
        527.4295043945312,
        504.8388366699219
      ],
      "text": "contacts (including children aged five years and above) and 6 million people living with HIV (including",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.979881286621094,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        500.80181884765625,
        209.0518035888672,
        518.038818359375
      ],
      "text": "(7) children) with TPT by 2022  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        532.0269775390625,
        151.04611206054688,
        556.8219604492188
      ],
      "text": "Rationale",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        562.27294921875,
        527.4179077148438,
        576.7159423828125
      ],
      "text": "To support countries in preventing and managing TB in children and adolescents, WHO’s Global",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        572.6788940429688,
        527.4296875,
        589.9158935546875
      ],
      "text": "Guidance for national tuberculosis programmes on the  Tuberculosis Programme published the WHO",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        585.87890625,
        527.3552856445312,
        603.1159057617188
      ],
      "text": "management of tuberculosis in children (second edition) (8)  in 2014  . Since the publication of the second",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.961281776428223,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        601.8729248046875,
        527.4025268554688,
        616.31591796875
      ],
      "text": "edition, new evidence related to diagnostic approaches for TB, treatment for drug-susceptible TB,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        615.0728759765625,
        527.48095703125,
        629.515869140625
      ],
      "text": "DR-TB and TB meningitis, as well as models of care relevant to children and adolescents has become",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999650001525879,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        625.4788818359375,
        527.419189453125,
        642.7158813476562
      ],
      "text": "WHO consolidated guidelines on tuberculosis. Module 5: management of tuberculosis  available. The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        638.6790161132812,
        527.4240112304688,
        655.916015625
      ],
      "text": "in children and adolescents  (2022) is a consolidated guideline of new and existing recommendations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        654.6729125976562,
        92.47999572753906,
        669.1159057617188
      ],
      "text": "(see",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        93.49449920654297,
        654.6729125976562,
        130.73829650878906,
        669.1159057617188
      ],
      "text": "annex 1",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        130.75559997558594,
        654.6729125976562,
        527.5861206054688,
        669.1159057617188
      ],
      "text": "), and replaces the 2014 guidance. It complements existing WHO guidelines on the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        667.8729248046875,
        527.2114868164062,
        682.31591796875
      ],
      "text": "management of TB, recognizing the unique characteristics and needs of these groups, as well as those",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.968153953552246,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        678.2788696289062,
        527.4380493164062,
        695.515869140625
      ],
      "text": "WHO operational  of their parents, caregivers and families. The guidelines are complemented by the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        691.4788818359375,
        527.4237670898438,
        708.7158813476562
      ],
      "text": "handbook on tuberculosis. Module 5: Management of tuberculosis in children and adolescents,  which",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        707.4730224609375,
        444.4250793457031,
        721.916015625
      ],
      "text": "provides guidance on how to implement the recommendations in the guidelines.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        460.0578918457031,
        801.0170288085938,
        555.0565185546875,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "Executive summary xvii",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
